{
  "id": "JHN.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yhn 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eidipayu kuna baa neloolo Yesu te Galilaya, amu meyieu neloolo te Yudea te nkaraki naing'oru Lyahudi pee ear ninye metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 23.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 16.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netinyikua osirua loo Lyahudi, aa osirua loo lng'oborri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etiakitia lalashera ninye, “Tung'uai ene shomo Yudea, pee edol sii ninche looiteng'eni linono isiaaitin niasita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu meetae oloas ai bae too nkisudorot laa keyieu ninye openy nelioyu aibalayu. Te naa iasita iyie nena baa aibalunye, imbalakinye kewan enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eitu doi eiruk ilalashera lenyena ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Eton eitu ebau enkata ai, kake etii enkata inyi oshi ake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meidim enkop aibayu intae, kake kaaiba nanu, amu kaishakenoki nchere arruok iasat enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elepa intae enchom osirua. Mailep nanu alo ele sirua amu eton eitu ebaya enkata ai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eidip atiaki ninche neijia, nebik te Galilaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu to sirua loo lng'oborri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eidipa lalashera lenyena aailepa aashom ilo sirua, neitoki sii ninye alo, neitu eitalio kewan, kake etiu anaa keisudori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku keing'oru ninye Lyahudi te ine to sirua, nejo, “Koree ninye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii olong'unyung'unyi atua esiamo te nkaraki ninye, ejo kulikae, “Oltung'ani supat,” nejo kulikae, “A'a keitapong'oo ninye olorere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore eyia neijia metii obo oimaki ninye aibalunye eurei Lyahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eitorito ilo sirua, neilep Yesu ajing enkaji e Nkai, neiteru aiteng'enisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'asia Ilyahudi nejo, “Kaji eiko pee eyiolo ele tung'ani sirat, neitu ae kata eiteng'eni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Yesu nejoki ninche, “Mme enaai enkiteng'enare ai, kake ene ilo laairriwua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nenyorraa oltung'ani aas eyieunoto e Nkai, keyiolou ineina kiteng'enare, te naa ke Nkai eing'uaa aashu te naa ai te nkitoria kewan ai airo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oloiro makewan, enchunet enye makewan eing'oru; kake ore ilo oing'oru enchunet e ilo oirriwua, nesipa ninye, nemetii inemesipa atua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keitu eisho intae Musa nkitanapat? Nemetii obo linyi oibung'ita nena kitanapat. Ainyoo pee king'oruru aar nanu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki olorere aajoki, “Aiata oloirirua. Aing'ae liking'oru aar?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Yesu ajoki ninche, “Ataasa esiaai nabo ning'asiate pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 17.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Te nkaraki ena pee eishoo intae Musa emuratare, neme Musa doi eing'uaa kake lekua loo papa, nimuratata intae oltung'ani te nkolong e sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yhn 5.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amaa amu kemurati oltung'ani te nkolong e Sabato pee megili nkitanapat e Musa, oo pee kigorokinono intae nanu amu aitaa oltung'ani biyoto katukul te nkolong e Sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eminguanare anaa inaalioo, kake enguanare te nkiguana oo sipat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kele doi Mesia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo kulikae le Yerusalem, “Aime ele doi eing'oruni aar metua? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eng'urai, eiro aibalie, neitu ejoki ninche ae. Keidimayu sa metaa keyioloi ilooitoreisho aajo ele Kristo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ele eikiyiolo eneing'uaa.” Naa tenelioyu kenya ilo oji Kristo eibalunye nemeetae oloyiolo eneing'uaa ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nkaraki ina etabua Yesu to nkaji e Nkai eiteng'enisho ejo, “Eikiyiololo nanu niyiololo enaing'uaa. Neitu alotu te yieunoto ai makewan, kake ore elde laairriwua ninye osipa, naa ninye miyiololo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayiolo nanu ninye, amu ninye aing'uaa naa ninye laairriwua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'oru ninche eneiko pee eibung ninye, kake metii obo oiteleikia enkaina ninye, amu eton eitu ebau esaa enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiruk ilkumok ninye ti atua olorere, nejo, “Amaa te nelotu Kristo, keas inkitoduaat kumok naalang inaasita ele tung'ani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eirriwayioki larripok meibung'a Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nening Ilfarisayo eimaki esiamo nena baa enyana, neirriwaa lapolosak kituaak o Lfarisayo larripok meshomo aaibung ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yesu ninche, “Eng'or enkiti kata eton atii te nebo intae, pee aitoki alo enetii ilo laairriwua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aikiyookiki aaing'oru, kake mikitumutumu, ore enatii nimindimidimi aaetu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejokino Lyahudi maate, “Kaji ejo pee elo, nimikitumie? Kejo pee elo enetii Lyahudi ooidapashakinote Ilyunani, nelo aiteng'en Ilyunani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalo rorei ele otejo, ‘Aikiyookiki aaing'oru nimikitumutumu, ore enatii nimindimidimi aaetu?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nchorroi naaimu enkare e nkishui",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 23.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te nkolong nabayie, naa ninye enkolong kitok e ilo sirua, neitashe Yesu nebuak ajo, “Te neeta oltung'ani enkure, inchoo elotu enatii aokisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.47.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 47.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Saka 14.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore olaairuk nanu, ore anaa enajo ilkigerot. ‘Keyooki aarukunye nchorroi e nkare naishu to ltau lenye.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee etejo ninye neijia, Enkiyang'et eimaka natum lelo pooki ooiruk ninye, amu eton eitu ebau ina Kiyang'et ina kata, amu eton eitu eilepieki Yesu metaa kitok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etoorote ltung'ana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening ematua e siamo kulo rorei nejo, “Esipa ilo oiboni ele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo kulikae, “Ele Kristo.” Nejo kulikae, “Ai Galilaya epukunye Kristo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 5.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keitu ejo lkigerot eishoi e Daudi eimu Kristo, apukunye Betlehem, enkang natii apa Daudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ina nejing empong'o atua esiamo te nkaraki ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyieu kulikae neibung ninye, kake metii oloitabaikia ninye enkaina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etanyaita larikok loo Lyahudi ninye.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu ilarripok enetii lapolosak kituaak o Lfarisayo, nejokini ninche, “Ainyoo pee eitu iyauu ninye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki larripok nejo, “Eitu ae kata eiro oltung'ani anaa enairo ele tung'ani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Lfarisayo ninche nejoki, “Keitapong'oyioki sii intae? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keetae too laitoriak anaa too Lfarisayo oloiruko ninye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ena siamo nemeyiolo nkitanapat, kedia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.1+JHN.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yhn 3.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Nikedemo ninche, olapa taa otang'asa alotu enetii Yesu, laa obo te lelo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amaa kedung'oki nkitanapat ang oltung'ani enkiguana eton eitu eng'asi aainining neyiolouni enaasita?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki aajoki ninye, “Aa Galilaya sii yie ing'uaa? Ing'oru tisipu: inchere meetae oloiboni opuku eing'uaa Galilaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu pooki tung'ani enkaji enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
